NOTICE OF MODIFICATION
----------------------

As required by section 4(b) of the License, this is notice that the files in
this distribution have been modified from the original work.

This repository is a community continuation of ekonbenefits/dynamitey, which
has been dormant since its 3.0.3 release in November 2023. It was created on
2026-09-05 by mirror-cloning the upstream repository and pushing to a new,
empty repository in the dynamitey-community organisation. The complete git
history of the original work is preserved.

The boundary is recorded in the repository itself. The tag

    upstream-baseline  ->  commit c44f5c57cb8a075e417b3eca9dc231d9eddaa7f6

marks the last commit that is purely the original authors' work. Every commit
reachable from that tag is theirs. Every commit after it belongs to this
project, and `git log upstream-baseline..main` lists the modifications
exactly.

Summary of the changes made after that point, at the time of writing:

  - Target frameworks changed from netstandard2.0;net40 to
    netstandard2.0;net10.0. The test project moved from net8.0;net48 to
    net10.0.
  - The inherited build and publish automation was removed and replaced.
  - The test suite was moved to NUnit 4, and its wall-clock performance
    fixture was moved out of the test suite into a separate benchmark project.
  - Dependencies were updated.

No change has been made to the identity of the published package. The
`Dynamitey` package on nuget.org remains the original authors' work, and this
project has not published a package or reserved a package identifier.

This NOTICE file is an addition. The original work did not include one.
